# --- 项目专属忽略配置 ---
# 策划数据表源在外部的 `配置表(JSON)` 目录
# 引擎内 StreamingAssets/Configs 下的文件仅为脚本同步副本，无需进入版本控制，避免冲突。
UnityClient/Assets/StreamingAssets/Configs/
UnityClient/Assets/StreamingAssets/Configs.meta
.idea

# Local AI image generation credentials/config
tools/美术工具/ai_image_gateway.local.yaml

# GIF character replacement exploratory runs; keep the example tooling itself versionable.
tools/美术工具/examples/gif_character_replace/gif_replace_*/

# Art pipeline workspace: keep only final approved assets in Git.
UnityClient/Assets/Art/_IncomingAI/
UnityClient/Assets/Art/_IncomingAI.meta

# Character-design generation evidence: keep prompts/reviews/metadata, ignore raw images.
# Curated files under a batch's selected/ directory remain versionable.
